# lahn course: written by tools/courses/make_ear_course.py (change it there, and run it again)
version 1
title Ear training
description lahn plays a note, you find it on your guitar and play it back: from two notes far apart to every note of a scale, then intervals by name.
instrument guitar


unit Hear it, find it

lesson High or low
text lahn plays an open string: the low E string or the high E string. They're far apart: listen, and play the one you hear.
text The first drill shows you where it is as it plays: sound and place, together. Then by ear: every string it could be is outlined. Space plays it again.
drill Heard and shown
type notes
notes E2 E4
show ear
where yes
count 6
pass 5
drill By ear
type notes
notes E2 E4
show ear
count 8
pass 7
drill No slips
type notes
notes E2 E4
show ear
count 8
pass 8

